RAMDISC
  The RAM discs.
RAMDISC v size
  A RAM disc as drive v (A-P): 64K, 256KB, 1MB ... (16K steps, 4MB in all).
  Real CP/M random access, any number of files open.
RAMDISC v 0   (or OFF)
  Dropped: its files are gone, its pages free again.
  A RAM disc outlives a reset (not a power off): COPY files to a disc.
  Z is CyborgOS's system drive (its commands).
